    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60318" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτεν-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>comb</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span> anaxil.<i><span class="en">
				39
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.404.4
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); <i>curry</i> horses, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήκτραισιν ἵππων τρίχας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1174
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ δὲ Πλάτων τοὺς ἑαυτοῦ διαλόγους
					κτενίζων καὶ βοστρυχίζων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτενίζεσθαι τὰς κόμας</span>
			<i>comb one's</i> hair, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.208
			</span></i>: so abs., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				603
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				148.4
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτενισμένος</span>
			<i>with one's hair combed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				165
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Semon.
				7.65
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ κτενισθείη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hippiatr.</u>
					94
				</span></i>
			.</div>
